skyline photo and a close-up of the clock tower, see the 2023-10-29 entry in ## Music and the Photography section of /memories/dave.md), Calvin recognized the clock tower and said he was in Boston a few years back — \"it's such a beautiful city.\" (a second, separate Boston visit, in addition to his late-2023-08/early-2023-09 visit above; \"a few years back\" — exact date not given) [S27T5][S27T7].\n- On 2023-11-13, told Dave he invited his old high school friend (the same friend he sightseeing'd with on 2023-10-24, see above) to see him perform in Boston — \"It was insane!\" — (recent as of 2023-11-13; the show date itself is not specified) (details in ## Relationships; Dave's side in the Relationships section of /memories/dave.md) [S29T1].\n- On 2023-11-16, attended a \"fancy gala\" in Boston (told Dave about it on 2023-11-17, as \"yesterday\") and met some interesting people; shared a photo of himself and \"the crew\" (a photography of a group of men sitting on a rock next to a river) (Dave: \"that event looks amazing! You all look awesome.\"; the Boston event — details in the 2023-11-17 entry of ## Relationships) [S30T2].","text_sha256":"5fba741e01530990ce8695d39e6fc6d80ed6ea12eda10ad460d70a7ff0843253","timestamp":null}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":553,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":44126,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":44679},"model":{"requested_model":"x-test-2","served_models":["deepseek-v4.1-flash"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"60d0c608bdda6e13c46a9e6cbf4cd7cae4f7eea8d7fcd2d8a4f8f9bde415df7c","filesystem_tools_sha256":"1632a476feccd761a1c6d21c9d2962d0975632f50d6c96678d69427a7f973ed7","orchestration_actions_sh